id: DRAFT-sniffit-0.7-rrev-pin-ohpcd-direct-build-ncursesw-fix
trigger_tool: conan|make|cc
phase: building|linking
error_signature: m4/1\.4\.19.*ERROR|/data/service/hnp/bin/bash.*inaccessible|ld\.lld: error: unable to find library -lncurses
severity: 3
category: build-system, autotools, ohos, network
match_keywords: rrev-pin, tool_requires, ncursesw, hmbs_repair_method, m4, libpcap, direct-build
title: CCI依赖链拖入m4源码构建失败时RREV-pin切至ohpcd配方并直编规避工具链及宽字符ncurses链接修正
root_cause: 裸libpcap先命中conancenter autotools配方经bison/flex拖入CCI-m4源码构建且其configure重exec profile钉死的缺失hnp bash导致Error127而本包generate域脚本无法触及依赖构建叠加ncurses宽字符静态包无libncurses致硬编码-lncurses链接失败
affected_scope: 依赖libpcap等经bison/flex传递引入CCI-m4源码构建且链接宽字符ncurses静态包的autotools类C库
verification_cmd: 真机conan create不再从源码构建m4/1.4.19且链接阶段无unable to find library -lncurses并全部门禁通过
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: rrev-pin-ohpcd-plus-direct-build-ncursesw-fix
rec_description: 将libpcap RREV-pin至ohpcd cmake配方切断CCI-bison/flex至m4边并删除automake/autoconf/libtool tool_requires改直编7个TU加生成config.h同时将-lncurses修正为随LIBS加-lpcap -lformw -lmenuw -lpanelw -lncursesw兜底
rec_command: conanfile.py requirements加RREV-pin libpcap至ohpcd并删tool_requires直编加config.h生成加链接改宽字符集；notes.md加链分析；MANIFEST.yml同步
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: keep-shell-hardening-wait-runner-fix
fallback_description: 若远端优先级不可调则保留本包SHELL加固并等待后端恢复runner的hnp bash或调整profile后再复检不重复改本包逻辑
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: -lncurses(?!w)
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在ncurses宽字符静态包下硬编码-lncurses包内仅有libncursesw.a而无libncurses.a
forbid_1_consequence: 真机ld.lld报unable to find library -lncurses导致build失败退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-aldo-0.7.8-vendoring-direct-build]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-sniffit-0.7-rrev-pin-ohpcd-direct-build-ncursesw-fix.md
last_updated: 2026-10-20
source_event: sniffit/0.7真机预检m4 configure Error127与-lncurses链接失败并修复通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 15383
